activity Submit Benefit Request
activity Review Benefit Request
activity Approve Benefit Request
activity Reject Benefit Request
activity Notify Employee
activity Process Payment
activity Update Employee Record
activity Audit Benefit Process
activity Submit Appeal
activity Review Appeal
activity Approve Appeal
activity Reject Appeal
activity Notify Appeal Decision
activity Conduct Benefit Orientation
activity Evaluate Benefit Utilization
bind Submit Benefit Request: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Type, Benefit Status
bind Review Benefit Request: Request ID, Employee ID
bind Approve Benefit Request: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Status, Benefit Amount
bind Reject Benefit Request: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Status
bind Notify Employee: Request ID, Employee ID, Notification Type
bind Process Payment: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Amount
bind Update Employee Record: Request ID, Employee ID, Benefit Type
bind Audit Benefit Process: Request ID, Audit ID
bind Submit Appeal: Request ID, Employee ID, Appeal Status
bind Review Appeal: Request ID, Employee ID
bind Approve Appeal: Request ID, Employee ID, Appeal Status
bind Reject Appeal: Request ID, Employee ID, Appeal Status
bind Notify Appeal Decision: Request ID, Employee ID, Notification Type
bind Conduct Benefit Orientation: Orientation ID
bind Evaluate Benefit Utilization: Utilization Rate
Request ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Employee ID: integer between 1 and 5000
Benefit Type: Health Insurance, Retirement Plan, Paid Leave, Education Assistance
Benefit Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Benefit Amount: float between 100.0 and 10000.0
Audit ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Notification Type: Approval, Rejection, Appeal Decision
Orientation ID: integer between 1 and 500
Utilization Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Appeal Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Init[Submit Benefit Request] | |
End[Notify Employee] | |
Existence[Review Benefit Request] | |
Existence[Conduct Benefit Orientation] | |
Existence[Evaluate Benefit Utilization] | |
Precedence[Approve Benefit Request, Review Benefit Request] | | |
Precedence[Reject Benefit Request, Review Benefit Request] | | |
Response[Approve Benefit Request, Notify Employee] |A.Benefit Status is Approved |A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d
Response[Reject Benefit Request, Notify Employee] |A.Benefit Status is Rejected |A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d
Response[Approve Benefit Request, Process Payment] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,7,d
Response[Approve Benefit Request, Update Employee Record] | |A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,5,d
Response[Process Payment, Audit Benefit Process] | |A.Request ID == T.Audit ID |0,30,d
Response[Submit Appeal, Review Appeal] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,5,d
Response[Approve Appeal, Notify Appeal Decision] |A.Appeal Status is Approved |A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d
Response[Reject Appeal, Notify Appeal Decision] |A.Appeal Status is Rejected |A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d